1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:02,880
If the Sun vanished right now,

2
00:00:02,920 --> 00:00:04,480
you wouldn't notice.

3
00:00:04,520 --> 00:00:05,985
Its light takes eight minutes

4
00:00:06,025 --> 00:00:08,130
and twenty seconds to reach us,

5
00:00:08,170 --> 00:00:09,765
so the Sun would keep shining

6
00:00:09,805 --> 00:00:10,960
in your sky.

7
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:12,530
Earth would even keep circling

8
00:00:12,570 --> 00:00:13,630
the empty spot,

9
00:00:13,670 --> 00:00:14,900
because gravity travels

10
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:16,730
at the speed of light too.

11
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:19,440
Then the sky goes dark,

12
00:00:19,480 --> 00:00:20,705
and Earth flies off

13
00:00:20,745 --> 00:00:21,755
in a straight line

14
00:00:21,795 --> 00:00:24,300
at about thirty kilometers a second.

15
00:00:24,340 --> 00:00:25,200
Within a week,

16
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:26,275
the average temperature

17
00:00:26,315 --> 00:00:28,240
would drop below freezing.

18
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:29,705
The oceans would freeze over

19
00:00:29,745 --> 00:00:30,405
on top,

20
00:00:30,445 --> 00:00:31,905
but stay liquid underneath

21
00:00:31,945 --> 00:00:33,520
for thousands of years,

22
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,700
warmed by Earth's own heat.

23
00:00:35,740 --> 00:00:36,785
Subscribe for more

24
00:00:36,825 --> 00:00:38,675
what-ifs like this.
